  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The acquisition of nutrient concentration data in the water column all over the Northwest Passage is crucial to evaluate the interannual variability of these nutrients in this particular region. The resulting nutrient distribution will also help identify supply sources of each studied nutrient as well as it will help quantify the effects of biological processes (e.g. uptake/release, nitrification, ammonification, etc.)."
